<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 256-6 V ENGLAND - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 256-6 V ENGLAND - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO, Zimbabwe 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe were 256 for six at the close on the opening day of the first test against England at Queen's Club on Wednesday</p>
